				<title>CRACK v1.0.36热修：AMD 9000系显卡崩溃问题已回滚修复</title>
				<link>https://info.steamhunter.link/posts/2026-10-27-4312190-e3e877b3/</link>
				<pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 22:05:22 +0800</pubDate>
